  "content": "<h2>2025 সালে প্রধান এআই ব্রেকথ্রু</h2><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg aria-label=\"AI Timeline 2025\" height=\"400\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><lineargradient id=\"bgGrad\" x1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y1=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-color:#E3F2FD\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-color:#E8EAF6\"></stop></lineargradient></defs><rect fill=\"url(#bgGrad)\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" width=\"800\"></rect><text fill=\"#1A237E\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"36\">AI Breakthroughs Timeline — 2025</text><line stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"80\" x2=\"720\" y1=\"200\" y2=\"200\"></line><circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"200\" fill=\"#1565C0\" r=\"8\"></circle><line stroke=\"#1565C0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"145\" x2=\"145\" y1=\"192\" y2=\"110\"></line><rect fill=\"#1565C0\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#0D47A1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"140\" x=\"75\" y=\"65\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"145\" y=\"86\">GPT-5 Launch</text><text fill=\"#BBDEFB\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"145\" y=\"103\">Advanced reasoning</text><circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"200\" fill=\"#7C3AED\" r=\"8\"></circle><line stroke=\"#7C3AED\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"275\" x2=\"275\" y1=\"208\" y2=\"280\"></line><rect fill=\"#7C3AED\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#4A148C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"140\" x=\"205\" y=\"283\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"275\" y=\"304\">Multimodal AI</text><text fill=\"#E1BEE7\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"275\" y=\"321\">Vision + Language</text><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"200\" fill=\"#E65100\" r=\"8\"></circle><line stroke=\"#E65100\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"400\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"192\" y2=\"110\"></line><rect fill=\"#E65100\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#BF360C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"140\" x=\"330\" y=\"65\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"86\">AI Agents</text><text fill=\"#FFE0B2\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"103\">Autonomous tasks</text><circle cx=\"530\" cy=\"200\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" r=\"8\"></circle><line stroke=\"#2E7D32\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"530\" x2=\"530\" y1=\"208\" y2=\"280\"></line><rect fill=\"#2E7D32\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"140\" x=\"460\" y=\"283\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"530\" y=\"304\">AI Robotics</text><text fill=\"#C8E6C9\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"530\" y=\"321\">Physical world AI</text><circle cx=\"660\" cy=\"200\" fill=\"#C62828\" r=\"8\"></circle><line stroke=\"#C62828\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"660\" x2=\"660\" y1=\"192\" y2=\"110\"></line><rect fill=\"#C62828\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#8E0000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"140\" x=\"590\" y=\"65\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"660\" y=\"86\">Open Source LLMs</text><text fill=\"#FFCDD2\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"660\" y=\"103\">Llama 3, Mistral</text><text fill=\"#1565C0\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"145\" y=\"225\">Q1</text><text fill=\"#7C3AED\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"275\" y=\"225\">Q2</text><text fill=\"#E65100\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"225\">Q2-Q3</text><text fill=\"#2E7D32\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"530\" y=\"225\">Q3</text><text fill=\"#C62828\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"660\" y=\"225\">Q4</text><rect fill=\"#E8EAF6\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#5C6BC0\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"400\" x=\"200\" y=\"360\"></rect><text fill=\"#1A237E\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"380\">2025: The Year AI Became Autonomous</text></svg></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>জেনারেটিভ ভিডিও মডেল:</strong> AI এখন টেক্সট প্রম্পট থেকে বাস্তবসম্মত ভিডিও সামগ্রী তৈরি করতে পারে। <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2ePf9rue1Ao\" target=\"_blank\">ডেমো দেখুন</a></li>\n<li><strong>স্বায়ত্তশাসিত মাল্টি-এজেন্ট সিস্টেম:</strong> এআই এজেন্টরা রিয়েল টাইমে জটিল ব্যবসায়িক কাজগুলি সমাধান করতে সহযোগিতা করে।</li>\n<li><strong>এআই-চালিত ড্রাগ আবিষ্কার:</strong> গভীর শিক্ষা ব্যবহার করে ক্যান্সার চিকিৎসার জন্য নতুন অণু আবিষ্কার করা হয়েছে।</li>\n<li><strong>মহাকাশ অনুসন্ধানে এআই:</strong> নাসা মঙ্গল মিশনে স্বায়ত্তশাসিত নেভিগেশন এবং ডেটা বিশ্লেষণের জন্য এআই মোতায়েন করেছে।</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>বৈশিষ্ট্যযুক্ত ভিডিও: জেনারেটিভ এআই ব্যাখ্যা করা হয়েছে</h3>\n<iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2ePf9rue1Ao\" title=\"জেনারেটিভ এআই ব্যাখ্যা করা হয়েছে\" width=\"560\"></iframe>\n<div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg aria-label=\"AI Capability Evolution\" height=\"400\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><lineargradient id=\"bgGrad2\" x1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y1=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-color:#E3F2FD\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-color:#F3E5F5\"></stop></lineargradient></defs><rect fill=\"url(#bgGrad2)\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" width=\"800\"></rect><text fill=\"#1A237E\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"36\">AI Capability Evolution</text><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" fill=\"none\" r=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" fill=\"none\" r=\"135\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" fill=\"none\" r=\"100\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" fill=\"none\" r=\"65\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"220\" fill=\"#1565C0\" r=\"30\"></circle><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"225\">Language</text><rect fill=\"#7C3AED\" height=\"25\" rx=\"6\" width=\"90\" x=\"355\" y=\"145\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"162\">Vision</text><rect fill=\"#E65100\" height=\"25\" rx=\"6\" width=\"110\" x=\"345\" y=\"80\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"97\">Reasoning</text><rect fill=\"#2E7D32\" height=\"25\" rx=\"6\" width=\"90\" x=\"480\" y=\"135\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"525\" y=\"152\">Action</text><rect fill=\"#C62828\" height=\"25\" rx=\"6\" width=\"100\" x=\"495\" y=\"205\"></rect><text fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"545\" y=\"222\">Autonomy</text><line stroke=\"#7C3AED\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"400\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"250\" y2=\"160\"></line><line stroke=\"#E65100\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"400\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"145\" y2=\"105\"></line><line stroke=\"#2E7D32\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"445\" x2=\"480\" y1=\"210\" y2=\"155\"></line><line stroke=\"#C62828\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"455\" x2=\"495\" y1=\"225\" y2=\"218\"></line><text fill=\"#1A237E\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" x=\"230\" y=\"110\">Each layer builds on previous</text><line marker-end=\"url(#aCap)\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"230\" x2=\"230\" y1=\"115\" y2=\"320\"></line><text fill=\"#616161\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" x=\"215\" y=\"160\">Text understanding</text><text fill=\"#616161\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" x=\"215\" y=\"200\">Image recognition</text><text fill=\"#616161\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" x=\"215\" y=\"240\">Complex logic</text><text fill=\"#616161\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" x=\"215\" y=\"280\">Tool use &amp; APIs</text><text fill=\"#616161\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" x=\"215\" y=\"320\">Self-directed goals</text><defs><marker id=\"aCap\" markerheight=\"7\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"10\" refy=\"3.5\"><polygon fill=\"#1A237E\" points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\"></polygon></marker></defs></svg></div><h3>ধাপে ধাপে: স্বায়ত্তশাসিত এজেন্টদের মোতায়েন করা</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>এজেন্টের ভূমিকা এবং কাজ সংজ্ঞায়িত করুন।</li>\n<li>LangChain বা LlamaIndex এর মত ফ্রেমওয়ার্ক ব্যবহার করুন।</li>\n<li>APIs এবং ডেটা উত্সগুলির সাথে একীভূত করুন৷</li>\n<li>এজেন্ট সহযোগিতা নিরীক্ষণ এবং অপ্টিমাইজ করুন।</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>অতিরিক্ত সম্পদ</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.nature.com/collections/ai\" target=\"_blank\">প্রকৃতি: এআই গবেষণা</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@TwoMinutePapers\" target=\"_blank\">টু মিনিট পেপারস (ইউটিউব)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@YannicKilcher\" target=\"_blank\">ইয়ানিক কিলচার (ইউটিউব)</a></li>\n</ul>",
